{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;This Demo lets you bargain and trade with the limited version of Wholesaler Simulator. Complete your fun Wholesaler Simulator experience by adding the full game to your wishlist!&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z-1_0005_Negotiation-with-Producers-14-01-2025.png?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Use your bargaining skills to buy products at the best possible prices.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/gif1__1_.gif?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z-1_0003_Stock-Management-14-01-2025.png?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rent warehouses to store and organize your inventory efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/2.gif?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z-1_0002_Delivery-and-Logistics-15-01-2025.png?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Deliver orders to customers and earn more profits.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/3.gif?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z-1_0006_Growth-and-Expansion-15-01-2025.png?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your warehouse capacity, purchase new vehicles, and expand your workforce to scale your operations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/4.gif?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z-1_0001_Free-Market-15-01-2025.png?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage every stage of your supply chain. Purchase goods from producers at the right time, optimize storage costs, and deliver products to customers quickly and efficiently to grow your business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/5.gif?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/extras/Ba\u015fl\u0131ks\u0131z-1_0004_Online-Orders-15-01-2025.png?t=1749856926\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Manage and fulfill customer orders using the in-game sales application on your PC.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3771010?t=1749856926","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771010/936a3ec77dc0e5a7eadbd012b370ddebc3437461/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1749856926","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3771